    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17487" root="زجر" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَجْرٌ</span></b>  inf. n. of 1. (S, A, Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A crying at
camels</i> [<i>&amp;c.</i>], <i>and an urging</i> or <i>inciting of them.</i>
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <i>A cry by which one chides,</i> i. e., either
<i>checks</i> or <i>urges, a beast &amp;c.;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَهْ</span> to a man,
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدَسْ</span> to a mule, &amp;c. (The lexicons, passim.) ＝ 
 
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also what next follows.

